{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國總統當勞·特朗普近日透露，他曾認真考慮將大西洋更名，但在與Google行政總裁桑達爾·皮查伊溝通後，決定暫時放棄這一想法。按照特朗普在一場集會上的説法，皮查伊告訴他，海洋與湖泊、海灣不同，涉及的國家太多，因此不希望Google地圖參與這次更名。特朗普隨後表示，自己可能會保留「大西洋」這一名稱，但又提出，可以考慮將太平洋改稱「美國洋」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583414.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:36.809059+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:14:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.243018+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.243018+00:00","content_hash":"401902245d039f4e0cb59b420577c7a83c10cea0fe81c2f07343e3b871fe7acb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}